    "text": "Eógan was the son of Ailill Olom and a grandson of Eógan Mór. He founded the Eóganacht, also called Owenacht, dynasty of the south. He rested with Lugaidh Mac Conn, his foster kin. They heard a harper play a yew tree. The brothers became enemies after that music. A druid, Dil Maccu Crecg, set the love match with Moncha. Their son became the ancestor of the kings of Munster.",
